  body: "# IIDB assessment and waiting-period boundaries\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe source separates pre-1
    October 1986 and later assessment conditions, including aggregation and disease-specific thresholds, and distinguishes
    onset and waiting-period exceptions.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nNeither a single percentage nor a universal
    90-day wait describes every case. DMG 69013 names disease-specific exceptions and a distinction between date
    of onset and addition to the schedule. No assessment, onset date, rate or award is computed.\n\n## Inspected
    passages\n\n- [DMG 69009, PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=3).\n\
    - [DMG 69010, PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=3).\n\
    - [DMG 69013, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=4).\n\
    - [DMG 69015, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=5).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol11-ch69`:
    PDF `3bbd376d12fc0a6633010680e88d11efdf7f5b34dde311016a073e80ac3e56b8`; extracted pages `fcaf30907d52d71cc7473cf40c8c876469efc3f8d18f7f9af7b3d32bf5016d95`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:34.033473Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6172830bd3bf7f55f94795f8/dmgch69.pdf#page=3
  semantic_relations:
  - target: term/prescribed-disease-version
